-- Separation axioms: T0 and T1 spaces below Hausdorff, points and finite
-- sets closed in T1 spaces, separation passes to subspaces and products,
-- and the regular and normal properties above Hausdorff
-- Part of Cumulus, the Grace17 mathematics library.
